    <h2>Brand</h2>
    <p>The Portico name, wordmark, symbol, and application icons may not be used to imply an official product, endorsement, or affiliation without permission.</p>
    <h2>Third-party work</h2>
    <p>Portico releases include notices for third-party libraries and assets where required. Those works remain subject to their own licenses.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
